{"ts":"2026-06-24T03:16:24.418Z","event":"step","at":"resolveLogCaller @ .next/dev/server/chunks/[root-of-the-server]__04tlv3b._.js:4468","goal":"和我聊聊前端新特性，并列出学习计划","stepId":"step-2","step":"制定学习计划","action":"generatePlan","status":"success","durationMs":12274,"dependsOn":["step-1"],"injectedContextPreview":"【讨论前端新特性】（id: step-1）\n最近前端领域有不少值得关注的进展，我挑几个实用的新特性聊聊吧：\n\n### 🌐 浏览器原生能力增强\n1. **视图过渡动画（View Transitions）**\n   Chrome 已支持通过 `document.startViewTransition()` 实现页面间/组件间的平滑过渡动画，无需复杂动画库，代码示例：\n   ```js\n   document.startViewTransition(() => {\n     // 更新DOM内容\n   });\n   ```\n\n2. **滚动驱动动画（Scroll-driven Animations）**\n   可直接用CSS绑定滚动位置控制动画进度，替代大量JavaScript监听逻辑：\n   ```css\n   @keyframes parallax {\n     from { transform: translateY(0); }\n     to { transform: translateY(-100px); }\n   }\n   .element {\n     animation: parallax linear;\n     animation-timeline: scroll();\n   }\n   ```\n\n### ⚡ JavaScript 语言进化\n1. **`Array.groupBy()`（阶段3提案）**\n   按分组条件归类数组元素：\n   ```js\n   const inventory = [\n     { name: \"asparagus\", type: \"vegetables\", quantity: 5 },\n     { name: \"bananas\", type: \"fruit\", quantity: 0 },\n     { name: \"cherries\", type: \"fruit\", quantity: 12 }\n   ];\n   const grouped = Array.groupBy(inventory, ({ type }) => type);\n   // { vegetables: [...], fruit: [...] }\n   ```\n\n2. **`structuredClone()` 深拷贝**\n   浏览器原生支持深拷贝（支持循环引用、特殊对象类型），替代 `JSON.parse(JSON.stringify())`：\n   ```js\n   const original = { data: [1, 2], meta: { time: Date.now() } };\n   const copy = structuredClone(original);\n   ```\n\n### 🚀 框架生态趋势\n1. **Server Actions（Next.js 13.4+）**\n   直接在组件中编写服务端函数，简化数据变更流程：\n   ```jsx\n   // actions.js\n   'use server'\n   export async function addToCart(productId) {\n     // 直接操作数据库\n   }\n\n   // 在组件中调用\n   import { addToCart } from './actions'\n   <button onClick={() => addToCart(id)}>Add</button>\n   ```\n\n2. **React Compiler（实验中）**\n   自动优化组件渲染，减少手动 `useMemo`/`useCallback` 的使用，提升性能。\n\n### 💡 实践建议\n- 逐步尝试用原生API替代polyfill（如视图过渡动画）\n- 关注浏览器兼容性（Can I Use实时查询）\n- 新框架特性可先在非核心模块试用\n\n最近在项目中尝试了哪些新特性？或者有特别想深入了解的方向吗？ 😄","attempt":0,"parallel":true}
